# Local / direct connections.
# A connection WITHOUT a TCPShield handshake is only accepted when it comes
# from one of these ranges. This is how players on your own network connect
# directly to the backend, bypassing TCPShield. One CIDR per line; lines
# starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
127.0.0.1/32
::1/128
192.168.2.0/24
